{
 "info": {
  "name": "MMG D:ONE \u2014 integration (0.4.3)",
  "description": "MMG D:ONE integration subset, firmware **0.4.3**. The earliest shipped units. Signs in with the operator PIN.\n\nSource selection, quad multiview, media and playlist playback, output modes and device state. Network configuration, firmware updates, credential management and fleet features are deliberately excluded.\n\nSet `baseUrl` to the unit. If an operator PIN is set on the unit, sign in with the full device API collection first; this subset carries no sign-in of its own.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Selecting a source does NOT leave the quad or stop media playback. To cut to a single source, POST /api/quad/enable {\"enabled\": false} first. Only GET /api/snapshot reports what is actually on the screen.\n\nThis is a subset, not the whole API. The unit serves more than is collected here \u2014 what is left out is what a control surface has no business doing. If you need something that is not in this collection, ask us: support@mmgaxis.io.\n\nGenerated by generate.py \u2014 do not hand-edit.",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
 "auth": {
  "type": "noauth"
 },
